{"bankId":"B-SRC-28-1898","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"rectangle_fence_with_gate_gap","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah menunjukkan kebun segi empat tepat 25 m × 18 m. Pagar dipasang mengelilinginya kecuali pada pintu masuk selebar 3 m. Berapakah panjang pagar yang diperlukan?","options":["83 m","80 m","86 m","89 m"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Perimeter kebun = 2(25 + 18) = 86 m.","Bahagian pintu masuk tidak dipagar, jadi 86 − 3 = 83 m."],"visual":{"kind":"rectangle","length_cm":25,"width_cm":18}}
