{"bankId":"B-SRC-28-1901","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0011","constructFamily":"third_item_half_price","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Harga sehelai baju ialah RM28. Dalam promosi, dua helai pertama dibayar harga penuh dan helai ketiga mendapat diskaun 50%. Berapakah jumlah bayaran untuk tiga helai?","options":["RM56","RM77","RM84","RM70"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Dua helai pertama = 2 × RM28 = RM56.","Helai ketiga = 50% × RM28 = RM14.","Jumlah = RM56 + RM14 = RM70."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-28-1902","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0012","constructFamily":"mean_after_replacing_one_value","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Purata enam nombor ialah 24. Jika satu nombor bernilai 18 digantikan dengan 30, berapakah purata baharu?","options":["26","25","27","28"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah asal = 6 × 24 = 144.","Jumlah baharu = 144 − 18 + 30 = 156.","Purata baharu = 156 ÷ 6 = 26."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-28-1903","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0001","constructFamily":"net_turn_angle_sequence","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Sebuah robot berpusing 90° mengikut arah jam, kemudian 135° lagi mengikut arah jam, dan akhirnya 45° lawan arah jam. Berapakah jumlah pusingan bersih mengikut arah jam?","options":["90°","180°","135°","225°"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah pusingan ikut arah jam = 90° + 135° = 225°.","Tolak 45° lawan arah jam: 225° − 45° = 180°."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-28-1904","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0013","constructFamily":"coordinate_two_axis_translation","plannedLevel":2,"question":"Titik P berada pada (4,3). P digerakkan 5 unit ke kanan dan 2 unit ke atas. Apakah koordinat baharu P?","options":["(7,5)","(9,1)","(9,5)","(11,5)"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Koordinat-x baharu = 4 + 5 = 9.","Koordinat-y baharu = 3 + 2 = 5.","Koordinat baharu ialah (9,5)."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-29-1961","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0002","constructFamily":"lcm_recurring_schedules","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Bas A tiba setiap 12 minit dan Bas B tiba setiap 18 minit. Kedua-duanya tiba bersama pada 8:00 pagi. Bilakah mereka akan tiba bersama lagi?","options":["8:24 pagi","8:30 pagi","8:54 pagi","8:36 pagi"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["KPK bagi 12 dan 18 ialah 36 minit.","8:00 pagi + 36 minit = 8:36 pagi."]}
