{"bankId":"B-SRC-29-1964","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0004","constructFamily":"nested_percentage_group_complement","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Daripada 300 murid, 40% ialah murid lelaki. Daripada murid lelaki itu, 25% memakai cermin mata. Berapakah murid lelaki yang tidak memakai cermin mata?","options":["30 murid","90 murid","120 murid","210 murid"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Murid lelaki = 40% × 300 = 120.","Memakai cermin mata = 25% × 120 = 30.","Tidak memakai cermin mata = 120 − 30 = 90."]}
